e Student\nGraduate\nGRADUATE (Professional Graduate Schools)\n1) Graduate school of Energy and Environment (KU-KIST GREEN SCHOOL)\nLeveraging the strong collaboration between KU and KIST (Korea Institute of Science and Technology), we serves as a pivotal think tank, dedicated to the development of national energy and environmental policies and technologies. Our mission is to cultivate innovative, interdisciplinary experts in policy and technology by integrating natural sciences, engineering, and humanities. We focus on fostering interdisciplinary talent, conducting forward-looking research, and providing strategic policy insights. We offer a unique educational approach that emphasizes global competitiveness and a future-oriented curriculum. By combining academic excellence with research collaboration, we strive to achieve top-tier educational and research outcomes.\n2) Graduate School of Management of Technology at Korea University\nGraduate School of Management of Technology at Korea University advances professionals in technology development, business planning, and commercialization through practical education and global collaboration, while focusing on field-oriented learning and industry-academia partnerships. At the intersection of technology and management, the program spans technology management, defense technology, and intellectual property, fostering new business growth through technology.\n3) Korea University Graduate School of Engineering & Technology\nThe graduate school\u2019s staff consists of 200 of Korea University\u2019s prestigious professors. To provide convenience for workers, the lectures are held at night. Therefore, students can do their own professional activities and study for a master's degree.\nThe masters program is for 5 semesters, and with the completion of 32 credits, You will be awarded a Master of Engineering degree. A person who has obtained a master\u2019s degree at our graduate school has the qualifications to enter the doctorate program at the regular graduate school.\nFamily Site\narrow_drop_down\n\uace0\ub824\ub300\ud559\uad50 \uacf5\uacfc\ub300\ud559 \ub300\ud559\uc6d0\n\uace0\ub824\ub300\ud559\uad50 \uacf5\uacfc\ub300\ud559 \uc720\ud29c\ube0c\n\uace0\ub824\ub300\ud559\uad50 \uacf5\uacfc\ub300\ud559 \ud559\uc0dd\ud68c(SNS)\n\uace0\ub824\ub300\ud559\uad50 \uad50\uc6b0\ud68c\nKUPID\nVisit Us\uff5c\nFacility Reservations\uff5c\nPrivacy\n[02841] College of Engineering Building 1 101, 145 Anam-ro, Seongbuk-gu, Seoul\nTEL 02-3290-4081~4 , 4125~8 FAX\n02-929-0901\nCopyrights (C)2023 Korea University. All Rights Reserved", "links": [["Vision & Mission", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/introduce/vision.html"], ["Why KUCE", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/introduce/active.html"], ["People", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/introduce/organization.html"], ["Brochure", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/introduce/brochure.html"], ["Visit Us", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/introduce/location.html"], ["Undergraduate", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/college.html"], ["Graduate", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/graduate.html"], ["Exchange Student", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/graduate.html"], ["Incoming", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/exchange_in.html"], ["Outgoing", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/exchange_out.html"], ["Research", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/research/research.html"], ["Admissions", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/academic/entrance_graduation.html"], ["Academic Calendar", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/graduate.html"], ["Undergraduate", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/academic/curriculum_college.html"], ["Graduate", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/academic/curriculum_graduate.html"], ["Administration", "https://eng.korea.ac.kr/eng/education/graduate.html"], ["Undergraduate open_in_new", "https://eng.korea.edu/eng_en/affairs/administration.do"], ["Graduate open_in_new", "https://eng.korea.edu/eng_en/affairs/administration.do"], ["Scholarships", "https://eng.korea.